msgid ""
"本章提供 ArduPilot、PX4、Viobot2、Jetson 和树莓派的接入说明。Jetson 和树莓派可通过串口与 "
"``D20_ros_driver`` 接入 ROS1/ROS2。"
msgstr ""
"This section covers integration with ArduPilot, PX4, Viobot2, Jetson, and "
"Raspberry Pi. Jetson and Raspberry Pi can connect over a serial port and "
"use ``D20_ros_driver`` with ROS1/ROS2."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "本章说明已经形成公开流程的飞控、机器人和设备平台接入。Jetson 和树莓派可通过串口与统一的 "
#~ "``D20_ros_driver`` 接入 ROS1/ROS2；典型行业方案将作为独立内容维护。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "This chapter explains the integration of"
#~ " flight control, robotics, and equipment"
#~ " platforms that have an established "
#~ "public process. Jetson and Raspberry Pi"
#~ " can connect to ROS1/ROS2 through the"
#~ " unified `D20_ros_driver` via serial port;"
